	abstract = {Artificial Intelligence (AI) is at the fore of revolutionary developments in the snappily changing world of technology and invention. This chapter explores the critical significance of AI in a variety of fields, including accoutrements wisdom and the construction assiduity, to show how these diligences have been significantly impacted by it. AI has ushered in a new age of material creation and discovery in the discipline of materials science. The application of AI methods like enhanced simulation to forecast material attributes, accelerating the hunt for high-performance materials. The periodic chart has been cleverly recreated by Atom2Vec; an unsupervised ML programme that classifies chemical elements based on their chemical environment. Additionally, AI has improved the effectiveness of large-scale simulations, enabling the investigation of intricate material structures and chemical interactions. AI has several functions in the building industry. Through the analysis of previous projects and the optimization of new ideas, it helps achieve a competitive advantage. AI assists project management throughout the execution stage by using drones for site scans and creating warnings for urgent problems. With AI's capacity to identify safety breaches and raise production through data analysis, safety and profitability are improved. Particularly remarkable is how AI has the ability to completely change the building sector. By gathering current information via sensors and drones, it transforms building sites into ‘smart’ sites. This data-driven strategy optimizes equipment maintenance and resource allocation, eventually improving efficiency and safety. AI is more than a technology; it is also a catalyst for creativity in a variety of fields. © 2024 Elsevier B.V., All rights reserved.},
